WEBVTT


00:00:46.033 --> 00:00:49.133
<i>Legend tells of a legendary warrior,...</i>


00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:52.231
<i>...whose kung fu skills
were the stuff of legend.</i>


00:00:53.431 --> 00:00:56.630
<i>He travelled the land
in search of worthy foes.</i>


00:01:07.928 --> 00:01:12.028
I see you like to chew.
Maybe you should on my fist!


00:01:13.527 --> 00:01:16.426
<i>The warrior said nothing
for his mouth was full.</i>


00:01:17.226 --> 00:01:20.126
<i>Then he swallowed.
And then he spoke.</i>


00:01:20.525 --> 00:01:22.324
Enough talk. Let's fight!


00:01:27.324 --> 00:01:30.423
<i>He was so deadly in fact,
that his enemies will go blind,...</i>


00:01:30.523 --> 00:01:33.023
<i>...from over exposure to pure
awesomeness.</i>


00:01:33.122 --> 00:01:35.122
- My eyes!
- He's too awesome!


00:01:35.222 --> 00:01:37.821
- And attractive.
- How can we re-pay you?


00:01:38.721 --> 00:01:42.620
There is no charge for awesomeness.
Or attractiveness.


00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:50.618
<i>It mattered not how many foes he faced.
They were no match for his bodacity.</i>


00:02:03.515 --> 00:02:07.615
<i>Never before had a panda
been so feared and so loved.</i>


00:02:08.914 --> 00:02:11.513
<i>Even the most heroic heroes
in all of China,...</i>


00:02:11.613 --> 00:02:16.713
<i>...The Furious Five, bowed in respect
to this great master.</i>


00:02:17.112 --> 00:02:18.612
We should hang out.


00:02:18.712 --> 00:02:20.212
Agreed.


00:02:23.111 --> 00:02:24.911
<i>But hanging out
would have to wait.</i>


00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:28.909
<i>Cause when you're facing the ten
thousand demons of demon mountain.</i>


00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:32.309
<i>There is only one thing
that matters and that’s...</i>


00:02:32.508 --> 00:02:35.908
- Po! Get up!
- You'll be late for work.


00:02:36.109 --> 00:02:37.107
What?


00:02:43.806 --> 00:02:45.806
Po, get up!


00:03:01.302 --> 00:03:04.501
Hey, Po.
What are you doing up there?


00:03:04.701 --> 00:03:06.601
Ah, nothing.


00:03:09.901 --> 00:03:14.300
Monkey, Mantis, Crane,
Viper, Tigress!


00:03:20.098 --> 00:03:22.897
Po, let's go.
You're late for work.


00:03:23.197 --> 00:03:24.597
Coming!


00:03:35.095 --> 00:03:36.095
Sorry dad.


00:03:36.195 --> 00:03:38.694
Sorry, doesn't make the noodles.


00:03:39.293 --> 00:03:41.493
What were you doing up there?
All that noise?


00:03:41.593 --> 00:03:44.193
Oh, nothing.
Just had a crazy dream.


00:03:44.393 --> 00:03:47.192
About what?
What were you dreaming about?


00:03:47.391 --> 00:03:48.792
What was I...


00:03:49.092 --> 00:03:51.291
...I was dreaming about a...


00:03:53.691 --> 00:03:55.090
Noodles.


00:03:55.190 --> 00:03:58.689
Noodles?
You were really dreaming about noodles?


00:03:58.889 --> 00:04:01.188
Yeah, what else would I be
dreaming about?


00:04:01.288 --> 00:04:03.789
Oh, careful.
That soup is... sharp!


00:04:03.988 --> 00:04:08.587
Oh, happy day. My son finally
having the noodle dream.


00:04:10.587 --> 00:04:14.486
You don't know how long
I have been waiting for this moment.


00:04:14.786 --> 00:04:16.685
This is a sign, Po.


00:04:17.285 --> 00:04:18.785
A sign of what?


00:04:18.985 --> 00:04:22.884
You are almost ready to be
entrusted with the secret ingredient,...


00:04:23.083 --> 00:04:25.684
...of my secret ingredient soup.


00:04:25.783 --> 00:04:30.582
And then you will fulfill your destiny
and take over the restaurant.


00:04:30.882 --> 00:04:34.181
Just as I took over from my father
who took over from his father...


00:04:34.281 --> 00:04:36.681
...who won it from a friend
over a game of mahjong.


00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:39.380
Dad, dad, dad.
It was just a dream.


00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:42.180
No, it was "the dream".


00:04:42.279 --> 00:04:45.479
We're noodle folk.
Broth runs through our veins.


00:04:46.178 --> 00:04:49.978
But dad, didn't you ever... I don't know,
wanted to do something else?


00:04:50.178 --> 00:04:51.977
Something beside noodles.


00:04:52.078 --> 00:04:54.877
Actually, when I was
young and crazy.


00:04:54.977 --> 00:04:58.976
I thought of running away
and learning how to make Toe Foo.


00:04:59.176 --> 00:05:00.475
So why didn't you?


00:05:00.475 --> 00:05:02.675
Oh, because it was
a stupid dream.


00:05:02.775 --> 00:05:05.674
Can you imagine me making Toe Foo?


00:05:06.774 --> 00:05:08.274
Toe Foo.


00:05:08.574 --> 00:05:12.073
No, we all have our place
in this world.


00:05:12.273 --> 00:05:16.071
- Mine is here and yours is...
- I know, is here.


00:05:16.272 --> 00:05:19.471
No, it’s tables 2, 5, 7 and 12.


00:05:19.571 --> 00:05:21.471
Service with a smile.


00:05:50.864 --> 00:05:52.763
Well done, students...


00:05:52.863 --> 00:05:54.863
...if you were trying
to disappoint me.


00:05:54.963 --> 00:05:57.963
Tigress, you need more ferocity.
Monkey greater speed.


00:05:58.162 --> 00:06:00.961
Crane, height.
Viper, subtlety. Mantis...


00:06:01.161 --> 00:06:02.861
- Master Shifu...
- What?


00:06:03.061 --> 00:06:05.660
It's... it's Master Oogway,
he wants to see you.


00:06:16.558 --> 00:06:20.557
Master Oogway, you summoned me?
Is something wrong?


00:06:26.355 --> 00:06:30.954
Why must something be wrong
for me to want to see my old friend?


00:06:31.255 --> 00:06:35.553
- So, nothing is wrong?
- Well, I didn't say that.


00:06:54.049 --> 00:06:55.349
You were saying?


00:06:56.049 --> 00:06:57.949
I have had a vision.


00:06:58.448 --> 00:07:01.048
Tai Lung will return.


00:07:06.247 --> 00:07:08.946
That is impossible.
He's in prison.


00:07:09.146 --> 00:07:11.846
Nothing is impossible.


00:07:12.746 --> 00:07:16.744
Zeng, fly to Chor Ghom Prison.
And tell them to double the guards,...


00:07:16.944 --> 00:07:19.343
...double the weapons.
Double everything.


00:07:19.443 --> 00:07:21.243
Tai Lung does not leave
that prison.


00:07:21.343 --> 00:07:22.743
Yes, Master Shifu.


00:07:24.942 --> 00:07:29.741
One often meets his destiny
on the road he takes to avoid it.


00:07:29.942 --> 00:07:32.641
We have to do something. We can't
just have him march in the valley.


00:07:32.741 --> 00:07:34.741
And take his revenge.
He'll, he'll...


00:07:34.841 --> 00:07:38.739
Your mind is like this water
my friend. When it is agitated...


00:07:38.939 --> 00:07:41.539
...it becomes difficult to see.


00:07:41.639 --> 00:07:47.638
But if you allow it to settle,
the answer becomes clear.


00:07:50.337 --> 00:07:51.937
The Dragon Scroll.


00:07:52.936 --> 00:07:55.536
- It is time.
- But who?


00:07:55.636 --> 00:07:59.235
Who is worthy to be trusted
with the secret to limitless power...


00:07:59.435 --> 00:08:03.233
...to become the Dragon Warrior?


00:08:04.233 --> 00:08:06.233
I don't know.


00:08:07.333 --> 00:08:09.233
Excuse me, excuse me.
Sorry.


00:08:09.732 --> 00:08:11.532
- Oh, sorry.
- Hey, watch it Po.


00:08:11.632 --> 00:08:12.431
Sorry.


00:08:14.831 --> 00:08:16.831
Sorry, a thousand pardon.


00:08:17.631 --> 00:08:18.730
What?


00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:23.329
Master Oogway is choosing
the Dragon Warrior, today.


00:08:23.529 --> 00:08:26.128
Everyone, everyone, go!
Get to the Jade Palace!


00:08:26.228 --> 00:08:28.328
One of the five is going
to get the Dragon's Scroll.


00:08:28.729 --> 00:08:31.428
We've been waiting a thousand
years for this. Just take the bowl!


00:08:31.827 --> 00:08:35.127
This is the greatest day in Kung Fu
history! Don't worry about it. Just go!


00:08:35.326 --> 00:08:37.726
Po! Where are you going?


00:08:38.526 --> 00:08:40.626
To the Jade Palace.


00:08:40.925 --> 00:08:43.325
But you're forgetting your noodle cart.


00:08:43.424 --> 00:08:47.624
The whole valley will be there and
you will sell noodle to all of them.


00:08:47.824 --> 00:08:50.323
Selling noodles?


00:08:51.923 --> 00:08:54.123
But Dad. You know I was kind
of thinking, maybe I...


00:08:54.922 --> 00:08:57.622
- Yeah?
- I was kind of thinking, maybe I...


00:09:01.121 --> 00:09:05.319
Could also sell the bean buns.
They're... They're about to go bad.


00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:09.619
That's my boy!
I told you that dream was a sign.


00:09:09.819 --> 00:09:12.918
Yeah...
I'm glad I had it.


00:09:16.917 --> 00:09:19.216
- I'm a kung fu warrior!
- Me too!


00:09:59.208 --> 00:10:00.407
Almost there.


00:10:01.207 --> 00:10:05.006
What? No!
Oh, no!


00:10:07.406 --> 00:10:10.105
- Sorry, Po.
- We'll bring you back a souvenir.


00:10:15.504 --> 00:10:18.703
No, I'll bring you back a souvenir.


00:10:24.002 --> 00:10:27.201
It's a historic day.
Isn't it Master Oogway?


00:10:27.402 --> 00:10:32.101
Yes. The one I feared
I would not live to see.


00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:35.500
- Are your students ready?
- Yes, Master Oogway.


00:10:37.299 --> 00:10:39.099
Now know this old friend...


00:10:39.399 --> 00:10:45.297
...whomever I chose will not only bring
peace to the valley, but also to you.


00:10:50.196 --> 00:10:53.395
Let the tournament begin!


00:11:09.392 --> 00:11:11.491
No, no, no, wait!
I'm coming.


00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:19.490
Hey! Open the door.


00:11:21.488 --> 00:11:23.488
Let me in!


00:11:24.288 --> 00:11:26.288
<i>Citizens of the Valley of Peace!</i>


00:11:26.888 --> 00:11:29.487
<i>It is my great honour
to present to you,...</i>


00:11:29.587 --> 00:11:34.486
<i>...Tigress, Viper, Crane,
Monkey, Mantis.</i>


00:11:34.786 --> 00:11:37.085
The Furious Five!


00:11:48.882 --> 00:11:50.483
They're The Furious Five!


00:11:52.482 --> 00:11:54.082
<i>Warriors prepare!</i>


00:11:54.182 --> 00:11:58.280
- Where's... Hah! A peeky hole.
- Ready for battle.


00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:02.180
The thousand tons of fire!


00:12:04.379 --> 00:12:07.079
- Wow, look at that!
- Hey! Get out of the way!


00:12:40.771 --> 00:12:44.370
<i>And finally, Master Tigress.</i>


00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:49.869
<i>Believe me citizens,
you have not seen anything yet.</i>


00:12:50.068 --> 00:12:51.469
I know!


00:12:51.469 --> 00:12:57.167
<i>Master Tigress faces Iron Arms
and it's "Blades of Death".</i>


00:13:09.264 --> 00:13:13.263
I sense the Dragon Warrior
is among us.


00:13:18.762 --> 00:13:21.462
Citizens of the Valley of Peace,...


00:13:21.562 --> 00:13:26.461
...Master Oogway will now choose
the Dragon Warrior.


00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:29.260
Ha? But I...
No, no, no wait!


00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:32.359
Yeah.


00:13:48.356 --> 00:13:51.354
Po! What are you doing?


00:13:51.655 --> 00:13:53.154
What does it look like I'm doing?


00:13:53.354 --> 00:13:56.354
Stop! Stop! I'm going to see
the Dragon Warrior.


00:13:59.553 --> 00:14:04.152
But I don't understand,
you finally have the noodle dream.


00:14:04.652 --> 00:14:08.151
I lied. I don't dream
about noodles, dad.


00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:16.449
I love Kung Fu!


00:14:25.948 --> 00:14:30.746
Oh, come on, son.
Let's get back to work.


00:14:33.445 --> 00:14:34.445
Okay.


00:14:38.444 --> 00:14:42.244
Po! Come back!


00:15:04.738 --> 00:15:08.237
Oh. What's going on?


00:15:09.637 --> 00:15:11.836
Where...?


00:15:13.736 --> 00:15:15.736
Why are you pointing...?


00:15:16.936 --> 00:15:22.334
Oh. Okay. Sorry. I just wanted
to see who the Dragon Warrior was?


00:15:22.634 --> 00:15:24.934
How interesting?


00:15:25.034 --> 00:15:27.733
Master, are you pointing at me?


00:15:28.033 --> 00:15:30.032
- Him.
- Who?


00:15:32.032 --> 00:15:34.232
- You.
- Me?


00:15:34.332 --> 00:15:39.831
The universe has brought us
the Dragon Warrior.


00:15:40.030 --> 00:15:41.230
- What?
- What?


00:15:41.829 --> 00:15:43.129
- What?
- What?


00:15:53.127 --> 00:15:56.127
Stop wait.
Who told you to...


00:16:05.325 --> 00:16:06.624
Master Oogway, wait.


00:16:06.624 --> 00:16:10.824
That flabby panda can't possibly
be the answer to our problem.


00:16:11.024 --> 00:16:14.722
You were about to appoint the Tigress
and that thing fell in front of her.


00:16:14.922 --> 00:16:19.122
- That was just an accident.
- There are no accidents.


00:16:34.018 --> 00:16:36.917
Forgive us, Master.
We have failed you.


00:16:37.117 --> 00:16:41.917
No. If the panda has not quit by morning,
then I would have failed you.


00:17:01.012 --> 00:17:02.812
Wait, wait, wait, wait!


00:17:02.912 --> 00:17:05.711
I bring a message from Master Shifu.


00:17:11.310 --> 00:17:15.609
What? Double the guard?
Extra precautions?


00:17:15.909 --> 00:17:18.707
Your prison may not be adequate?


00:17:21.407 --> 00:17:24.506
You doubt my prison security?


00:17:24.807 --> 00:17:27.206
Absolutely not!


00:17:27.306 --> 00:17:30.105
Shifu does.
I'm just the messenger.


00:17:30.205 --> 00:17:33.805
I'll give you a message
for your Master Shifu.


00:17:34.304 --> 00:17:37.804
Escape from Chor Ghom prison
is impossible.


00:17:42.303 --> 00:17:44.602
Impressive, isn't it?


00:17:45.502 --> 00:17:49.001
Yes, very impressive.
It's... It's very impressive.


00:17:49.101 --> 00:17:51.800
One way in, one way out.


00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:55.900
One thousand guards
and one prisoner.


00:17:56.299 --> 00:18:00.399
Yes, except that prisoner is Tai Lung.


00:18:04.397 --> 00:18:05.897
Take us down.


00:18:23.993 --> 00:18:25.392
Oh, my!


00:18:29.792 --> 00:18:32.691
Behold Tai Lung.


00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:37.390
I'll... Uhm...
I'll just wait right here.


00:18:37.490 --> 00:18:41.189
It's nothing to worry about.
It's perfectly safe.


00:18:41.989 --> 00:18:45.389
- War posts! At the ready.
- War posts?


00:18:46.188 --> 00:18:48.788
Hey, tough guy.
Did you hear?


00:18:48.888 --> 00:18:51.387
Oogway is finally going to give
someone the Dragon Scroll...


00:18:51.587 --> 00:18:53.387
...and it's not going to be you.


00:18:53.387 --> 00:18:55.086
What are you doing?
Don't get him mad.


00:18:55.186 --> 00:18:59.785
What is he going to do about it?
I've got him completely immobilised.


00:19:03.484 --> 00:19:06.983
Oh, did I step on
the woolly kiddy's tail?


00:19:08.083 --> 00:19:09.983
I'm gonna... I've seen enough.


00:19:09.983 --> 00:19:12.382
I'm gonna tell Shifu,
he has nothing to worry about.


00:19:12.482 --> 00:19:15.081
- No, he doesn't.
- Okay I'll tell him that.


00:19:16.181 --> 00:19:17.881
Can we please go now?


00:19:42.475 --> 00:19:44.075
Oh. Wait a second.


00:19:49.274 --> 00:19:51.174
I think there has been
a slight mistake.


00:19:51.273 --> 00:19:53.273
Everyone seems
to think I'm, err...


00:19:56.673 --> 00:20:00.172
The sacred Hall of Warriors.
No way!


00:20:01.272 --> 00:20:03.071
Look at this place.


00:20:04.270 --> 00:20:08.470
Master Flying-Rhino's armour.
With authentic battle damage!


00:20:09.569 --> 00:20:12.368
Wow! The Sword of Heroes.


00:20:12.768 --> 00:20:15.967
Said to be so sharp, you can cut
yourself just by looking...


00:20:17.967 --> 00:20:20.167
The invisible "Trident of Destiny".


00:20:22.366 --> 00:20:25.365
I've only seen paintings
of that painting.


00:20:31.764 --> 00:20:33.064
No!


00:20:35.563 --> 00:20:37.763
The legendary "Urn of
Whispering Warriors".


00:20:37.862 --> 00:20:40.862
Said to contain souls of the
entire Tenshu army.


00:20:44.361 --> 00:20:47.561
- Hello?
- Have you finished sightseeing?


00:20:47.661 --> 00:20:49.860
Sorry. I should have
come to see you first.


00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:51.759
- My patience is running thin.
- Ohh?


00:20:51.859 --> 00:20:54.759
Well. I mean, it's not like
you are going anywhere.


00:20:54.959 --> 00:20:57.158
- You turn around.
- Sure.


00:20:57.158 --> 00:21:00.657
Hey, how is it going?
How do you get 500... Master Shifu!


00:21:03.057 --> 00:21:06.756
Someone broke that.
But I'm going to fix it... I'll... I'll...


00:21:06.957 --> 00:21:09.656
Do you have some glue?


00:21:12.755 --> 00:21:13.654
I've a splinter.


00:21:13.754 --> 00:21:16.554
So you are the legendary
Dragon Warrior?


00:21:16.954 --> 00:21:19.853
- Ahh, I guess so?
- Wrong!


00:21:20.253 --> 00:21:23.453
You are not the Dragon Warrior.
You will never be the Dragon Warrior...


00:21:23.552 --> 00:21:27.151
...until you've learned the secret
of the Dragon scroll.


00:21:28.151 --> 00:21:31.551
Wow. So... Uhm...
How does this work?


00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:34.750
Do you have a ladder?
A trampoline or...?


00:21:35.850 --> 00:21:37.649
You think it is that easy?


00:21:37.649 --> 00:21:41.048
That I'm just going to hand you
the secret to limitless power?


00:21:41.248 --> 00:21:42.248
No! I...


00:21:42.248 --> 00:21:45.048
One must first master the highest
level of Kung Fu...


00:21:45.248 --> 00:21:49.246
...and that is clearly impossible
if that one is someone like you.


00:21:49.346 --> 00:21:50.747
- Someone like me?
- Yes!


00:21:50.847 --> 00:21:54.845
Look at you!
This fat butt, flabby arms.


00:21:55.045 --> 00:21:57.745
Those are sensitive
in the flabby parts.


00:21:57.845 --> 00:22:00.444
And this ridiculous belly.


00:22:00.544 --> 00:22:04.743
- And utter disregard for personal hygiene.
- Now wait a minute.


00:22:04.943 --> 00:22:08.143
- That's a little uncalled for... - Don't stand
that close. I can smell your breath.


00:22:08.243 --> 00:22:09.642
Listen, Oogway said that I was the...


00:22:09.742 --> 00:22:13.141
Uh... the Wuxi Finger Hold.
No, Wuxi Finger Hold.


00:22:14.740 --> 00:22:16.040
You know this hold?


00:22:16.141 --> 00:22:19.040
Developed by Master Wuxi
in the 3rd dynasty. Yes.


00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:21.839
Then you must know what happens
when I flex my pinky.


00:22:21.940 --> 00:22:23.439
No, no, no.


00:22:23.639 --> 00:22:28.238
You know the hardest part of this?...
The hardest part is cleaning up afterwards.


00:22:29.038 --> 00:22:31.437
Okay. Okay, take it easy.


00:22:31.537 --> 00:22:33.837
Now listen closely, Panda.


00:22:33.936 --> 00:22:37.036
Oogway may have picked you,
but when I'm through with you,...


00:22:37.236 --> 00:22:40.435
...I promise you,
you're going to wish he hadn't.


00:22:40.835 --> 00:22:42.134
Are we clear?


00:22:42.234 --> 00:22:45.134
Yes, we're clear, we're clear.
We are so clear.


00:22:45.334 --> 00:22:48.933
Good. I can't wait to get started.


00:23:28.824 --> 00:23:30.024
Let's begin.


00:23:30.124 --> 00:23:31.324
Wait, wait, wait.


00:23:31.423 --> 00:23:32.423
What?


00:23:34.123 --> 00:23:36.622
- Now?
- Yes, now.


00:23:36.823 --> 00:23:40.621
Unless you think that the great Oogway was
wrong and you are not the Dragon Warrior.


00:23:40.721 --> 00:23:46.220
Okay. Well, I don't know
if I can do all of those moves.


00:23:46.720 --> 00:23:49.520
Well, if we don't try,
we will never know, will we?


00:23:49.620 --> 00:23:53.418
Yeah, it's just, maybe we can find
something more suited to my level.


00:23:53.618 --> 00:23:55.718
- And what level is that?
- Well, you know...


00:23:55.818 --> 00:23:59.717
I'm not a master, but
let's just start at zero.


00:23:59.817 --> 00:24:04.916
- Level zero.
- No, there is no such thing as level zero.


00:24:05.215 --> 00:24:07.115
Hey, maybe I can start with that.


00:24:07.115 --> 00:24:12.114
That? We use that for training children
and for popping the door open when it is hot.


00:24:13.214 --> 00:24:14.713
But if you insist.


00:24:14.814 --> 00:24:17.013
Wow! The Furious Five.


00:24:17.413 --> 00:24:19.613
You're so much bigger
than your action figures.


00:24:19.713 --> 00:24:22.312
Except for you, Mantis.
You're about the same.


00:24:23.511 --> 00:24:26.511
Go ahead, Panda.
Show us what you can do.


00:24:29.710 --> 00:24:32.809
Are they going to watch? Or should I just
wait until they get back to work or something?


00:24:33.109 --> 00:24:36.809
- Hit it.
- Okay, I mean, I just ate...


00:24:37.009 --> 00:24:42.007
...and so I'm still digesting, so my
Kung Fu may not be as good as later on.


00:24:42.207 --> 00:24:43.607
Just hit it.


00:24:44.606 --> 00:24:45.606
Alright.


00:24:46.307 --> 00:24:49.606
What'd you got?
You've got nothing cos' I got it right here.


00:24:49.806 --> 00:24:52.905
You picking on my friends?
Get ready to fell the thunder.


00:24:53.105 --> 00:24:55.504
Come on, crazy feet.
What're you going to do about crazy feet?


00:24:55.604 --> 00:24:58.503
Come on. I'm a blur. I'm a blur.
You've never seen Bear style.


00:24:58.604 --> 00:25:00.303
You've only seen Praying Mantis.


00:25:00.403 --> 00:25:04.902
Or Monkey style.
Or imagine snake-kiddy Snake.


00:25:05.102 --> 00:25:06.402
Would you hit it?


00:25:07.501 --> 00:25:09.501
Alright. Alright.


00:25:16.100 --> 00:25:18.699
Why don't you try it again?
A little harder.


00:25:20.298 --> 00:25:22.398
How's that?...


00:25:32.696 --> 00:25:34.295
Oh, that hurts!


00:25:41.494 --> 00:25:43.794
This will be easier than I thought.


00:25:44.694 --> 00:25:47.193
Feeling a little nausea.


00:25:52.191 --> 00:25:53.491
My tenders.


00:26:22.284 --> 00:26:23.885
How did I do?


00:26:23.985 --> 00:26:27.484
There is now a level zero.


00:26:28.083 --> 00:26:30.183
- There is no words.
- Don't denying that.


00:26:30.383 --> 00:26:32.682
I don't understand
what Master Oogway was thinking.


00:26:32.782 --> 00:26:37.481
- Poor guy is going to get himself killed.
- He is so mighty.


00:26:37.781 --> 00:26:42.580
The Dragon Warrior fell out
of the sky in a ball of fire.


00:26:42.780 --> 00:26:44.980
When he walks,
the very ground shakes.


00:26:46.279 --> 00:26:50.479
One would think that Master Oogway would
choose someone who actually knew Kung Fu.


00:26:50.678 --> 00:26:54.978
- Yeah or could at least touch his toes.
- Or even see his toes.


00:27:19.572 --> 00:27:20.971
Okay.


00:27:29.670 --> 00:27:31.469
Great.


00:27:44.966 --> 00:27:47.565
Oh, hey. Hi.
You're up?


00:27:47.665 --> 00:27:52.264
- Am now.
- I was just... er... someday... huh?


00:27:53.064 --> 00:27:56.663
The Kung Fu stuff is hard work, right?
Your biceps sore.


00:27:58.163 --> 00:28:02.462
I've had a long day and rather
disappointing day, so... er...


00:28:03.661 --> 00:28:07.061
Yeah... I should probably
get to sleep now.


00:28:07.161 --> 00:28:09.160
- Yeah, yeah, yeah, of course.
- Okay. Thanks.


00:28:09.360 --> 00:28:11.760
It's just, I'm...
I'm such a big fan...


00:28:12.360 --> 00:28:14.859
You guys were so totally amazing
at the battle of the Weeping River.


00:28:15.159 --> 00:28:18.858
Outnumbered a thousand to one.
But, you didn't stop. You just,...


00:28:20.958 --> 00:28:22.957
Oh. Sorry about that.


00:28:23.357 --> 00:28:26.357
Ahh... Look you don't belong here.


00:28:28.056 --> 00:28:31.455
I know, I know.
You're right.


00:28:31.555 --> 00:28:34.754
I don't have it.
It's just, my whole life, I dreamed of...


00:28:34.954 --> 00:28:38.553
No, no, no. I meant you don't
belong here, I mean in this room.


00:28:38.754 --> 00:28:42.952
But this is my room.
Property of Crane.


00:28:43.252 --> 00:28:46.352
Oh, okay. Right, right.
So...


00:28:46.552 --> 00:28:49.951
Yeah, you want to get to sleep.
I'm keeping you up.


00:28:50.051 --> 00:28:51.851
We've got big things tomorrow.


00:28:52.250 --> 00:28:56.050
Alright. You are awesome. The last thing
I'm going to say. Okay, bye-bye.


00:28:59.949 --> 00:29:02.748
- What was that?
- I didn't say anything.


00:29:02.949 --> 00:29:06.648
Okay. Alright. Good night.
Sleep well.


00:29:08.947 --> 00:29:10.846
Seem a little bit awkward.


00:29:13.145 --> 00:29:15.445
Master Tigress, didn't mean
to wake you. Just a...


00:29:15.545 --> 00:29:18.245
- You don't belong here.
- Ah, yeah. Yeah, of course.


00:29:18.345 --> 00:29:22.844
- This is your room... - I mean you don't
belong in the Jade Palace.


00:29:23.044 --> 00:29:27.143
You're a disgrace to Kung Fu and if
you have any respect of who we are...


00:29:27.343 --> 00:29:31.842
...and what we do,
you will be gone by morning.


00:29:37.040 --> 00:29:38.840
Big fan.


00:29:46.238 --> 00:29:50.138
I see you've found the Sacred
Peach Tree of Heavenly Wisdom.


00:29:52.337 --> 00:29:56.836
Is that what this is? I'm so sorry.
I thought it was just a regular peach tree.


00:29:57.736 --> 00:30:02.035
I understand.
You eat when you are upset.


00:30:02.634 --> 00:30:06.133
Upset? I'm not upset. Why? Why?
What makes you think that I'm upset?


00:30:07.634 --> 00:30:10.133
So, why are you upset?


00:30:15.032 --> 00:30:18.431
I probably sucked more today
than anyone in the history of Kung Fu.


00:30:18.930 --> 00:30:20.631
In the history of China.


00:30:20.631 --> 00:30:22.230
In the history of sucking.


00:30:22.530 --> 00:30:23.330
Probably.


00:30:23.529 --> 00:30:27.429
And the Five... Man, you should have
seen them, they totally hate me.


00:30:27.629 --> 00:30:28.629
Totally.


00:30:28.729 --> 00:30:32.028
How's Shifu ever going to turn me
into the Dragon Warrior?


00:30:34.527 --> 00:30:37.927
I mean, I'm not like the Five.
I've got no claws.


00:30:38.226 --> 00:30:43.125
No wings, no venom.
Even Mantis got those thingies.


00:30:44.625 --> 00:30:47.624
May be I should just quit
and go back to making noodles.


00:30:51.224 --> 00:30:56.422
Quit. Don't quit.
Noodles. Don't noodles.


00:30:57.522 --> 00:31:02.021
You are too concerned with
what was and what will be.


00:31:02.321 --> 00:31:07.020
There's a saying.
Yesterday is history,


00:31:07.220 --> 00:31:12.019
Tomorrow is a mystery,
But today is a gift.


00:31:12.419 --> 00:31:16.118
That is why it is called the "present".


00:31:45.412 --> 00:31:46.811
- Oh, no!
- What's happening?


00:31:47.811 --> 00:31:50.410
To your battle stations!
Go! Go! Go!


00:31:59.008 --> 00:32:02.107
- Fire Cross-Bow!
- Fire!


00:32:04.507 --> 00:32:06.407
Fire!


00:32:13.605 --> 00:32:16.004
Tai Lung's free. I must warn Shifu.


00:32:16.204 --> 00:32:18.104
You are not going anywhere.
Neither is he!


00:32:18.204 --> 00:32:19.803
- Let go of me.
- Bring it up!


00:32:22.703 --> 00:32:24.803
- Wait!
- Bring it back!


00:32:42.999 --> 00:32:45.498
- He's going this way.
- He won't get far.


00:32:45.598 --> 00:32:47.797
Archers!


00:33:55.481 --> 00:33:57.982
We're dead.
So very, very dead.


00:33:59.081 --> 00:34:01.280
Not yet, we're not.
Now!


00:34:48.970 --> 00:34:51.969
- Can we run now?
- Yes.


00:35:12.364 --> 00:35:14.064
I'm glad Shifu sent you.


00:35:16.063 --> 00:35:17.963
I was beginning to think
I've been forgotten.


00:35:19.063 --> 00:35:24.762
Fly back there and tell them, the real
Dragon Warrior is coming home.


00:35:36.858 --> 00:35:38.658
Good Morning, Master.


00:35:39.658 --> 00:35:40.958
Panda!


00:35:41.858 --> 00:35:43.857
Panda! Wake up!


00:35:47.357 --> 00:35:49.056
He's quitted.


00:35:51.056 --> 00:35:53.755
What do we do now Master
with the Panda gone?


00:35:53.855 --> 00:35:55.855
Who will be the Dragon Warrior?


00:35:55.955 --> 00:35:58.753
All we can do is resume your
training and trust that in time...


00:35:59.054 --> 00:36:01.653
...the true Dragon Warrior
will be revealed.


00:36:03.352 --> 00:36:04.653
What are you doing here?


00:36:05.652 --> 00:36:07.352
Hey. Good morning, Master.


00:36:07.452 --> 00:36:09.552
I thought I'll warm up a little.


00:36:11.851 --> 00:36:15.250
- You're stuck.
- Stuck?...No...What?...Stuck?


00:36:16.350 --> 00:36:19.049
No... This is one of the...
Yeah... I'm stuck.


00:36:19.149 --> 00:36:21.049
- Help him.
- Oh, dear.


00:36:22.449 --> 00:36:24.448
Lift me on three.
One, two,...


00:36:28.547 --> 00:36:30.247
- Thank you.
- Don't mention it.


00:36:30.447 --> 00:36:32.546
- No, really. I appreciate it...
- Ever.


00:36:33.746 --> 00:36:37.745
You actually thought you could
learn to do a full split in one night?


00:36:37.945 --> 00:36:40.944
It takes years to develop
ones flexibility.


00:36:41.044 --> 00:36:44.743
And years longer
to apply it in combat.


00:36:54.442 --> 00:36:56.041
Put that down!


00:36:56.141 --> 00:37:00.440
The only souvenirs we collect here
are bloody knuckles and broken bones.


00:37:00.640 --> 00:37:04.039
Yeah! Excellent!


00:37:04.339 --> 00:37:05.939
Let's get started.


00:37:07.938 --> 00:37:10.237
- Are you ready?
- I was born ready...Oww!


00:37:11.738 --> 00:37:14.636
I'm sorry brother.
I thought you said you're ready.


00:37:14.736 --> 00:37:17.736
That was awesome!
Let's go again!


00:37:44.330 --> 00:37:48.429
I've been taking it easy on you Panda
but no more. Your next opponent...


00:37:48.629 --> 00:37:51.328
...will be me.
- Alright. Yeah, let's go!


00:37:54.027 --> 00:37:55.827
Step forth!


00:37:56.727 --> 00:37:59.626
The true path to victory is to find
your opponent's weakness.


00:37:59.726 --> 00:38:01.726
And make him suffer for it.


00:38:02.226 --> 00:38:06.325
Oh yeah. To take his strength
and use it against him.


00:38:06.624 --> 00:38:10.024
Until he finally falls or quits.


00:38:10.224 --> 00:38:15.023
But a real warrior never quits.
Don't worry Master, I'll never quit.


00:38:25.820 --> 00:38:28.720
If he is smart he won't
come back those steps.


00:38:29.220 --> 00:38:32.619
- But he will.
- He's not going to quit, is he?


00:38:32.919 --> 00:38:35.318
He's not going to quit bouncing.
I'll tell you that.


00:38:47.815 --> 00:38:50.615
I thought you said accupuncture
will make me feel better.


00:38:50.715 --> 00:38:54.115
Trust me it will. It's just not easy
finding right nerve points...


00:38:54.214 --> 00:38:56.614
...under all this...
- Fat? - Fur!


00:38:56.714 --> 00:38:58.813
- I was going to say fur.
- Sure you were.


00:38:59.113 --> 00:39:01.213
Who am I to judge a warrior
based on his size?


00:39:01.313 --> 00:39:05.411
I mean, look at me.
I'm over here.


00:39:05.612 --> 00:39:08.910
Maybe you should take
a look at this again.


00:39:10.411 --> 00:39:11.810
Okay.


00:39:12.110 --> 00:39:15.709
Ouch!
Stop it! Stop it!


00:39:17.509 --> 00:39:20.308
I know Master Shifu is trying
to inspire me and all.


00:39:20.609 --> 00:39:24.208
But if I didn't know any better
I'd say he's trying to get rid of me.


00:39:29.306 --> 00:39:32.106
I know he can seem like heartless.


00:39:32.206 --> 00:39:34.305
But you know he wasn't
always like that.


00:39:34.405 --> 00:39:40.003
According to legend there was once a time
when Master Shifu actually used to smile.


00:39:40.304 --> 00:39:43.502
- No... - Yes.
- But that was before...


00:39:44.003 --> 00:39:46.702
- Before what?
- Before Tai Lung.


00:39:46.802 --> 00:39:49.502
Aah... Yeah. We are not really
suppose to talk about him.


00:39:49.901 --> 00:39:52.800
Well, if he is going to stay here
he should now.


00:39:52.901 --> 00:39:55.000
Guys, guys,
I know about Tai Lung.


00:39:55.100 --> 00:40:00.199
He was a student. The first to ever
master the 1000 scrolls of Kung Fu.


00:40:00.699 --> 00:40:04.498
And then he turned bad
and now he's in jail.


00:40:04.998 --> 00:40:06.898
He wasn't just a student.


00:40:11.297 --> 00:40:13.896
<i>Shifu found him as a cub.</i>


00:40:15.595 --> 00:40:17.995
<i>And he raised him as his son.</i>


00:40:21.494 --> 00:40:23.893
<i>And when the boy showed
talent in Kung Fu...</i>


00:40:24.993 --> 00:40:27.093
<i>...Shifu trained him.</i>


00:40:27.393 --> 00:40:31.492
<i>He believed in him. He told him
he was destined for greatness.</i>


00:40:33.192 --> 00:40:35.391
<i>It was never enough for Tai Lung.</i>


00:40:37.690 --> 00:40:39.890
<i>He wanted the Dragon Scroll.</i>


00:40:39.990 --> 00:40:43.690
<i>But Oogway saw darkness
in his heart and refused.</i>


00:40:44.589 --> 00:40:47.788
<i>Outraged, Tai Lung
laid waste to the Valley.</i>


00:40:50.088 --> 00:40:52.487
<i>He tried to take the Scroll by force.</i>


00:40:52.687 --> 00:40:56.786
<i>And Shifu had to destroy
what he had created.</i>


00:40:58.686 --> 00:41:00.385
<i>But how could he?</i>


00:41:14.482 --> 00:41:18.282
<i>Shifu loved Tai Lung like
he had never love anyone before.</i>


00:41:26.680 --> 00:41:28.079
<i>Or since.</i>


00:41:36.678 --> 00:41:39.676
And now he has a chance
to make things right.


00:41:39.776 --> 00:41:41.976
To train the true Dragon Warrior.


00:41:42.076 --> 00:41:44.175
And he is stuck with you.


00:41:44.676 --> 00:41:48.674
A big fat Panda
who treats it like a joke.


00:41:49.774 --> 00:41:51.774
- Ohh... That's it!
- Wait! My fault!


00:41:51.874 --> 00:41:53.874
I accidentally tweaked
his facial nerves.


00:41:56.273 --> 00:41:58.573
And may have also stopped his heart.


00:42:01.072 --> 00:42:02.671
Inner peace.


00:42:05.270 --> 00:42:07.270
Inner peace.


00:42:10.170 --> 00:42:15.168
Inner...in...in...in
inner peace.


00:42:18.168 --> 00:42:22.367
Look, whoever is making that
flapping sound, quiet down.


00:42:26.266 --> 00:42:28.265
Inner...


00:42:31.865 --> 00:42:34.864
Oh, Zeng. Excellent.


00:42:35.564 --> 00:42:37.963
I could use some good news right now.


00:42:45.361 --> 00:42:47.062
Master. Master.


00:42:47.062 --> 00:42:51.260
I... I... have... It's a...
It's a very bad news.


00:42:51.561 --> 00:42:57.459
Aah, Shifu. There's just news.
There's no good or bad.


00:42:57.959 --> 00:43:01.058
Master, your vision...
Your vision was right.


00:43:01.258 --> 00:43:04.457
Tai Lung has broken out of prison.
He's on his way.


00:43:05.957 --> 00:43:08.356
That is bad news...


00:43:08.857 --> 00:43:13.055
...if you do not believe that
the Dragon Warrior can stop him.


00:43:13.755 --> 00:43:17.354
Panda? Master, that Panda
is not the Dragon Warrior.


00:43:17.454 --> 00:43:20.554
He wasn't even meant to be here.
It was an accident.


00:43:20.854 --> 00:43:23.453
There are no accidents.


00:43:24.453 --> 00:43:27.452
Yes, I know.
You said that already.


00:43:27.752 --> 00:43:31.852
- Twice.
- Well, that was no accident either.


00:43:31.951 --> 00:43:34.251
- Thrice.
- My old friend.


00:43:34.750 --> 00:43:39.249
The Panda will never fulfill
his destiny, nor you, yours.


00:43:39.449 --> 00:43:42.848
Until you let go of the
illusion of control.


00:43:43.048 --> 00:43:45.248
- Illusion?
- Yes.


00:43:45.448 --> 00:43:47.547
Look at this tree, Shifu.


00:43:47.647 --> 00:43:50.447
I cannot make it blossom
when it suits me.


00:43:50.547 --> 00:43:53.846
Nor make it bear
fruit before it's time.


00:43:54.046 --> 00:43:56.645
But there are things
we can control.


00:43:58.045 --> 00:44:00.344
I can control when
the fruit will fall.


00:44:01.544 --> 00:44:02.944
And I can control...


00:44:04.344 --> 00:44:05.644
...where to plant the seed.


00:44:06.843 --> 00:44:09.742
That is no illusion, Master.


00:44:11.342 --> 00:44:17.740
Ah yes, but no matter what you do,
that seed will grow to be a peach tree.


00:44:18.241 --> 00:44:20.940
You may wish for
an apple or an orange.


00:44:21.340 --> 00:44:26.339
- But you will get a peach.
- But a peach cannot defeat Tai Lung.


00:44:27.139 --> 00:44:33.137
Maybe it can, if you are willing
to guide it, to nurture it.


00:44:34.437 --> 00:44:36.236
To believe in it.


00:44:36.236 --> 00:44:40.136
But how? How?
I need your help, Master.


00:44:40.336 --> 00:44:44.134
No, you just need to believe.


00:44:44.535 --> 00:44:50.033
Promise me, Shifu.
Promise me, you will believe.


00:44:50.433 --> 00:44:55.932
- I... I will try.
- Good.


00:44:58.432 --> 00:45:00.831
My time has come.


00:45:02.730 --> 00:45:06.330
You must continue your journey
without me.


00:45:06.929 --> 00:45:09.029
What?...what?...what are you...
Wait!


00:45:10.728 --> 00:45:12.428
Master.


00:45:12.928 --> 00:45:14.628
You can't leave me.


00:45:18.127 --> 00:45:21.126
You must believe.


00:45:22.126 --> 00:45:24.425
Master!


00:45:52.919 --> 00:45:56.918
- I'm not scared.
- Yeah. Sound like fun. He maybe a wolf.


00:45:57.019 --> 00:45:59.917
You may be the scariest bandit
in Harjin Province.


00:46:00.317 --> 00:46:02.717
- But you're a lousy tipper.
- Really.


00:46:02.917 --> 00:46:05.716
So, how did you
get out of there alive?


00:46:05.916 --> 00:46:11.814
I mean, I didn't actually said that,
but I thought it, in my mind.


00:46:12.615 --> 00:46:15.914
If he could read my mind
he would have been like...what?


00:46:16.114 --> 00:46:18.413
Order up!
You like it?


00:46:20.413 --> 00:46:22.313
This is really good.


00:46:22.413 --> 00:46:25.112
Now, come on. You should try
my dad's secret ingredient soup.


00:46:25.212 --> 00:46:27.711
He actually knows the secret ingredient.


00:46:28.211 --> 00:46:30.210
What are you talking about?
This is amazing.


00:46:30.310 --> 00:46:32.711
- Wow, you are really a good cook.
- I wish my mouth was bigger.


00:46:32.810 --> 00:46:35.010
Tigress, you got to try
Hmm...


00:46:35.210 --> 00:46:39.208
It is said that the Dragon Warrior can
survive for months at a time on nothing...


00:46:39.408 --> 00:46:43.608
...but the dew of a single Gingko leaf
and the energy of the universe.


00:46:45.007 --> 00:46:48.107
I guess my body doesn't know
it's the Dragon Warrior yet.


00:46:48.706 --> 00:46:54.005
I need lot more than dew
and the universe juice.


00:46:58.205 --> 00:47:01.303
- What?
- Oh, nothing, Master Shifu.


00:47:04.203 --> 00:47:07.202
You will never be the Dragon Warrior
unless you lose 500 pounds...


00:47:07.403 --> 00:47:10.701
...and brush your teeth.
What is the noise you're making?


00:47:10.701 --> 00:47:12.501
Laughter?
I have never heard of it.


00:47:12.701 --> 00:47:17.800
Work hard Panda and maybe someday
you'll have ears like mine.


00:47:19.200 --> 00:47:20.999
That's good.
Oh...oh, yup.


00:47:21.299 --> 00:47:23.799
Ears?
It's not working for you.


00:47:23.899 --> 00:47:25.898
- I thought they're pretty good.
- It's Shifu!


00:47:26.198 --> 00:47:28.298
Of course it's Shifu.
What do you think I'm doing?


00:47:30.797 --> 00:47:32.496
Master Shifu.


00:47:35.396 --> 00:47:38.595
You think this is funny!
Tai Lung has escaped from prison!


00:47:38.795 --> 00:47:40.594
- And you all are acting like children!
- What?


00:47:40.695 --> 00:47:44.794
He's coming for the Dragon Scroll and
you're the only one who can stop him.


00:47:47.993 --> 00:47:51.193
And here I am saying you've
got no a sense of humour.


00:47:51.293 --> 00:47:55.091
I am gonna... step down.
What? You're serious?


00:47:55.291 --> 00:47:59.690
And I have to... I... No...
Master Oogway will stop him.


00:47:59.890 --> 00:48:02.790
- He did it before. He'll do it again.
- Oogway can not!


00:48:03.489 --> 00:48:05.889
- Not anymore.
- Ha?


00:48:06.289 --> 00:48:08.988
Our only hope is the Dragon Warrior.


00:48:09.188 --> 00:48:10.688
- The Panda?
- Yes, the Panda!


00:48:10.688 --> 00:48:14.287
Master please, let us stop Tai Lung?
This is what you train us for!


00:48:14.487 --> 00:48:19.386
No! It is not your destiny
to defeat Tai Lung! It is his!


00:48:20.086 --> 00:48:21.386
Where did he go?


00:48:29.284 --> 00:48:32.183
You cannot leave!
A real warrior never quits!


00:48:32.383 --> 00:48:33.482
Watch me!


00:48:36.382 --> 00:48:39.181
Come on! How am I suppose
to beat Tai Lung?


00:48:39.482 --> 00:48:41.381
I can't even beat you to the stairs.


00:48:41.481 --> 00:48:44.480
You will beat him because
you are the Dragon Warrior.


00:48:45.180 --> 00:48:46.780
You don't believe that!


00:48:46.780 --> 00:48:48.579
You never believed that.


00:48:48.680 --> 00:48:51.579
From the first moment I got here,
you've been trying to get rid of me.


00:48:51.678 --> 00:48:53.978
Yes, I was!


00:48:54.078 --> 00:48:59.077
But now I ask you to trust in your Master
as I have come to trust in mine.


00:49:00.277 --> 00:49:03.776
You are not my Master.
And I am not the Dragon Warrior.


00:49:04.076 --> 00:49:07.275
Then why didn't you quit?
You knew I was trying to get rid of you.


00:49:07.475 --> 00:49:10.374
- Yet you stayed.
- Ya. I stayed.


00:49:10.374 --> 00:49:13.773
I stayed because every time
you threw a brick at my head...


00:49:13.973 --> 00:49:16.573
...or said I smelled, it hurt!


00:49:17.173 --> 00:49:21.871
But it could never hurt more than
it did everyday in my life just being me.


00:49:22.971 --> 00:49:26.871
I stayed because I thought
if anyone could change me,...


00:49:27.370 --> 00:49:30.470
...could make me, not me...


00:49:30.670 --> 00:49:35.069
...it was you. The greatest
Kung Fu teacher of all of China.


00:49:35.369 --> 00:49:40.768
But I can change you! I can turn
you into the Dragon Warrior. And I will!


00:49:40.967 --> 00:49:44.367
Come on, Tai Lung is
on his way right now.


00:49:44.666 --> 00:49:46.666
And even if it takes him
a hundred years to get here.


00:49:46.766 --> 00:49:51.365
How are you gonna to change this
into the Dragon Warrior?


00:49:51.665 --> 00:49:52.964
Hah?


00:49:55.064 --> 00:49:56.563
How?


00:49:57.563 --> 00:49:59.064
How?


00:50:01.363 --> 00:50:03.862
- How?
- I don't know!


00:50:11.560 --> 00:50:13.160
I don't know.


00:50:20.358 --> 00:50:22.358
That's what I thought.


00:51:00.350 --> 00:51:02.449
This is what you trained me for.


00:51:09.947 --> 00:51:11.347
Tigress!


00:51:14.746 --> 00:51:16.646
Don't try to stop me.


00:51:19.445 --> 00:51:21.744
- We are not trying to stop you.
- What?


00:51:21.844 --> 00:51:23.844
We are coming with you.


00:52:36.928 --> 00:52:40.126
What?
I eat when I am upset, okay!


00:52:41.126 --> 00:52:42.926
Oh! No need to explain.


00:52:43.026 --> 00:52:46.925
I just thought you might be monkey.
He hides his almond cookies in the top-shelf.


00:53:08.221 --> 00:53:09.920
Don't tell Monkey.


00:53:09.920 --> 00:53:10.920
Look at you.


00:53:11.020 --> 00:53:16.019
- Yeah, I know. I disgust you.
- No, I mean, how did you get up there?


00:53:16.219 --> 00:53:21.217
I don't know,... I just...
I don't know. Just get the cookies.


00:53:21.417 --> 00:53:26.616
And yet you are 10 feet off the ground
and have done a perfect split.


00:53:27.116 --> 00:53:32.615
No, this?
This is just an accident!


00:53:36.014 --> 00:53:38.114
There are no accidents.


00:53:39.513 --> 00:53:40.513
Come with me.


00:53:48.412 --> 00:53:51.310
I know you are trying to be
all mystical and Kung Fu-ey.


00:53:52.011 --> 00:53:55.009
But could you least tell me
where we are going?


00:54:04.408 --> 00:54:09.507
You drag me all the way
out here for a bath?


00:54:13.806 --> 00:54:18.605
Panda, we do not wash our pits
in the pool of sacred tears.


00:54:18.904 --> 00:54:21.104
Uuh?...The pool of...


00:54:21.104 --> 00:54:25.803
This is where Oogway unraveled
the mysteries of harmony and focus.


00:54:26.102 --> 00:54:29.902
This is the birth place of Kung Fu.


00:54:44.398 --> 00:54:47.598
- Do you want to learn Kung Fu?
- Yeah.


00:54:47.698 --> 00:54:52.297
- Then I am your Master.
- Okay!


00:54:54.496 --> 00:54:56.496
- Don't cry.
- Okay.


00:55:02.295 --> 00:55:07.894
When you focus on Kung Fu,
when you concentrate, you stink.


00:55:08.393 --> 00:55:12.992
But perhaps that is my fault. I cannot
train you the way I've trained the Five.


00:55:13.492 --> 00:55:17.691
I now see that the way to get
through to you is with this.


00:55:17.891 --> 00:55:20.791
Great, cause I am hungry.


00:55:22.090 --> 00:55:25.290
Good, when you have been trained
you may eat.


00:55:27.089 --> 00:55:28.488
Let's begin.


00:56:38.873 --> 00:56:40.372
After you, Panda.


00:56:40.472 --> 00:56:45.371
Just like that?
No setups? No, ten-mile hike?


00:56:45.871 --> 00:56:50.770
I vowed to train you and you've been
trained. You are free to eat.


00:56:55.669 --> 00:56:56.968
Enjoy.


00:56:58.768 --> 00:57:01.968
- Hey!
- I said you are free to eat.


00:57:02.068 --> 00:57:03.867
Have a dumpling.


00:57:12.565 --> 00:57:15.264
- You are free to eat.
- Am I?


00:57:15.364 --> 00:57:17.264
Are you?


00:58:43.545 --> 00:58:45.144
I am not hungry.


00:58:48.843 --> 00:58:50.643
Master.


00:59:20.136 --> 00:59:21.436
Cut it!


00:59:38.531 --> 00:59:42.231
- Where is the Dragon Warrior?
- How do you know you are not looking at her?


00:59:43.331 --> 00:59:45.230
You think I'm a fool.


00:59:45.531 --> 00:59:48.929
I know you are not the Dragon Warrior.
None of you!


00:59:49.230 --> 00:59:52.328
I heard how he fell out of the sky
on a ball of fire.


00:59:52.529 --> 00:59:56.927
But he's a warrior unlike anything
in the world has ever seen.


00:59:57.128 --> 01:00:00.426
- Po?
- So that is his name.


01:00:00.827 --> 01:00:02.326
Po!


01:00:02.626 --> 01:00:05.626
Finally, a worthy opponent.


01:00:05.826 --> 01:00:08.825
Our battle will be legendary.


01:00:28.421 --> 01:00:30.520
We got this, help her.


01:00:55.015 --> 01:00:57.314
- Monkey!
- Go!


01:01:09.811 --> 01:01:11.411
Mantis!


01:01:15.410 --> 01:01:16.710
Now!


01:02:02.599 --> 01:02:05.099
Shifu, taught you well.


01:02:07.998 --> 01:02:09.798
But he didn't teach you everything.


01:02:13.996 --> 01:02:17.296
- You have done well, Panda.
- Done well?


01:02:17.495 --> 01:02:21.195
Done well!
I have done awesome!


01:02:22.295 --> 01:02:25.594
The mark of a true hero is humility.


01:02:26.094 --> 01:02:29.693
But yes,
you have done, awesome.


01:02:37.492 --> 01:02:39.991
Guys? Guys!


01:02:40.091 --> 01:02:42.090
They're dead.
No, they are breathing.


01:02:42.190 --> 01:02:44.290
They're asleep?
No, their eyes are open.


01:02:44.390 --> 01:02:46.490
We were no match
for his nerve attack.


01:02:46.590 --> 01:02:48.789
He has gotten stronger.


01:02:49.588 --> 01:02:51.688
Who? Tai Lung?
Stronger?


01:02:52.688 --> 01:02:55.688
He's too fast.
Sorry, Po.


01:02:57.387 --> 01:03:00.786
- I thought we could stop him.
- He could have kill you.


01:03:00.986 --> 01:03:03.086
- Why didn't he?
- So you can come back here...


01:03:03.185 --> 01:03:06.685
...and strike fear into our hearts.
But it won't work.


01:03:07.185 --> 01:03:10.483
It might. I mean a little.


01:03:10.884 --> 01:03:13.983
- I'm pretty scared.
- You can defeat him, Panda.


01:03:14.083 --> 01:03:18.082
Are you kidding?
If they can't... They're Five Masters.


01:03:18.282 --> 01:03:19.681
I'm just one me.


01:03:19.681 --> 01:03:23.280
But you have the one thing
that no one else does.


01:03:28.380 --> 01:03:30.679
You really believe I'm ready?


01:03:30.879 --> 01:03:33.478
You are, Po.


01:04:22.967 --> 01:04:25.767
Behold, the Dragon Scroll.


01:04:26.666 --> 01:04:29.166
- It is yours.
- Wait.


01:04:29.666 --> 01:04:32.065
- What happens when I read it?
- No one knows.


01:04:32.165 --> 01:04:35.364
But legend says you will be able
to hear a butterfly's wings beat.


01:04:35.564 --> 01:04:38.364
- Wow! Really? That's cool.
- Yes!


01:04:38.464 --> 01:04:43.662
And see light in the deepest cave.
You will feel the universe in motion around you.


01:04:43.862 --> 01:04:47.562
Wow! Can I punch through walls?
Can I do a quadruple back flip?


01:04:47.762 --> 01:04:50.861
- Focus. Focus. Focus!
- Oh, yeah, yeah.


01:04:51.061 --> 01:04:53.860
Read it Po,
and fulfill your destiny.


01:04:54.260 --> 01:04:58.259
Read it and become the Dragon Warrior.


01:05:05.158 --> 01:05:06.757
It's impossible to open.


01:05:08.457 --> 01:05:09.957
Come on! Come on, now!


01:05:13.156 --> 01:05:14.755
Thank you.


01:05:14.755 --> 01:05:16.955
Probably, loosen it up for you.


01:05:18.255 --> 01:05:19.955
Okay, here goes.


01:05:31.852 --> 01:05:33.451
- It's blank.
- What?


01:05:33.652 --> 01:05:36.950
- Here, look.
- No, I am forbidden to look upon...


01:05:43.249 --> 01:05:48.248
Blank! I don't...
I don't understand.


01:05:49.348 --> 01:05:55.146
Okay. So like Oogway was
just a crazy old turtle after all.


01:05:55.346 --> 01:05:57.846
No. Oogway was wiser than us all.


01:05:57.946 --> 01:06:01.745
Oh, come on.
Face it. He picked me by accident.


01:06:02.045 --> 01:06:04.645
Of course, I'm not Dragon Warrior.


01:06:05.044 --> 01:06:06.843
Who am I kidding?


01:06:07.244 --> 01:06:10.243
- But who will stop Tai Lung?
- He will destroy everything.


01:06:10.443 --> 01:06:13.342
- And everyone.
- No.


01:06:13.843 --> 01:06:17.442
Evacuate the Valley.
You must protect the villagers...


01:06:17.642 --> 01:06:19.141
...from Tai Lung's rage.


01:06:19.141 --> 01:06:20.440
What about you, Master?


01:06:20.540 --> 01:06:22.041
- I will fight him.
- What?


01:06:22.241 --> 01:06:25.740
I can hold him off long enough
for everyone to escape.


01:06:25.840 --> 01:06:28.539
But Shifu, he'll kill you.


01:06:28.839 --> 01:06:31.638
Then I would have finally
paid for my mistake.


01:06:32.138 --> 01:06:34.038
Listen to me, all of you.


01:06:34.137 --> 01:06:37.737
It's time for you to continue
your journey without me.


01:06:37.836 --> 01:06:40.336
I am very proud to have
been your master.


01:07:03.231 --> 01:07:05.230
We got to get them out safely.


01:07:05.230 --> 01:07:07.530
Come little one,
let's find your Mama.


01:07:07.630 --> 01:07:11.029
Viper, gather the southern farmers.
Mantis, the north.


01:07:11.229 --> 01:07:13.029
Crane, light the way.


01:07:31.125 --> 01:07:33.924
Look, it's the Dragon Warrior.


01:07:42.722 --> 01:07:44.222
Hey Dad.


01:07:44.721 --> 01:07:46.321
Po!


01:07:51.520 --> 01:07:53.919
It's good to have you back son.


01:07:56.519 --> 01:08:00.118
- Good to be back.
- Let's go, Po.


01:08:02.718 --> 01:08:08.516
For our next shop, it's time to face it.
The future of noodles is diced cut vegetables.


01:08:08.816 --> 01:08:13.015
No longer slices.
Also, I was thinking...


01:08:13.115 --> 01:08:18.014
...maybe this time we'll have
a kitchen you can stand up in.


01:08:19.313 --> 01:08:20.614
You like that?


01:08:26.712 --> 01:08:33.611
Po, I'm sorry things didn't work out.
It just wasn't meant to be.


01:08:38.210 --> 01:08:42.408
Po, forget everything else.
Your destiny still awaits.


01:08:42.609 --> 01:08:47.408
We are noodle folk.
Broth runs deep through our veins.


01:08:47.707 --> 01:08:53.406
I don't know dad. Honestly, sometimes
I can't believe I'm actually your son.


01:08:57.105 --> 01:09:02.704
Po, I think it's time I told you
something I should have told you...


01:09:03.103 --> 01:09:05.103
...a long time ago.


01:09:05.604 --> 01:09:06.803
Okay.


01:09:08.203 --> 01:09:12.702
The secret ingredient of
my secret ingredient soup.


01:09:14.802 --> 01:09:18.900
Come near me.
The secret ingredient is...


01:09:19.700 --> 01:09:21.900
- Nothing!
- Hah?


01:09:21.900 --> 01:09:24.299
You heard me.
Nothing!


01:09:24.599 --> 01:09:26.998
There is no secret ingredient.


01:09:27.098 --> 01:09:30.198
Wait, wait.
It's just plain old noodle soup?


01:09:30.298 --> 01:09:32.597
You don't add some kind
of special sauce or something.


01:09:32.697 --> 01:09:35.096
Don't have to.
To make something special...


01:09:35.196 --> 01:09:37.996
...you just have to believe
it's special.


01:09:47.993 --> 01:09:50.793
There is no secret ingredient.


01:10:11.688 --> 01:10:14.288
I have come home, Master.


01:10:14.487 --> 01:10:18.086
This is no longer your home
and I am no longer your master.


01:10:18.287 --> 01:10:21.786
Yes, you have a new favourite.


01:10:21.986 --> 01:10:25.485
So where is this Po?


01:10:26.785 --> 01:10:30.783
- Did I scare him off?
- This battle is between you and me.


01:10:31.883 --> 01:10:37.382
- So that's how it's going to be.
- That is how it must be.


01:10:51.979 --> 01:10:54.578
I rotted in jail for 20 years...


01:10:54.778 --> 01:10:58.478
...because of your weakness!
- Obeying your master is not weakness!


01:10:58.578 --> 01:11:01.677
You knew I was the Dragon Warrior!


01:11:01.876 --> 01:11:07.776
You always knew.
But when Oogway said otherwise...


01:11:08.375 --> 01:11:10.175
...what did you do?


01:11:10.775 --> 01:11:12.874
What did you do?


01:11:16.074 --> 01:11:18.673
- Nothing! - You were not meant
to be the Dragon Warrior.


01:11:18.873 --> 01:11:21.972
- That was not my fault!
- Not your fault?


01:11:22.072 --> 01:11:24.372
Who filled my head with dreams?


01:11:24.372 --> 01:11:26.771
Who drove me to train
until my bones cracked?


01:11:26.871 --> 01:11:29.971
Who denied me and my destiny?


01:11:38.768 --> 01:11:41.268
It was never my decision to make!


01:11:47.067 --> 01:11:48.766
It is now.


01:11:54.065 --> 01:11:58.464
- Give me the Scroll.
- I would rather die!


01:12:46.953 --> 01:12:50.552
What I ever did,
I did to make you proud!


01:12:50.652 --> 01:12:53.752
Tell me how proud you are Shifu!


01:12:54.052 --> 01:12:57.850
Tell me!
Tell me!


01:13:08.348 --> 01:13:11.847
I...I have always
been proud of you.


01:13:13.047 --> 01:13:18.246
From the first moment,
I have been proud of you.


01:13:19.045 --> 01:13:22.945
And it was my pride
that blinded me.


01:13:23.345 --> 01:13:26.944
I love you too much to see
what you were becoming.


01:13:28.043 --> 01:13:32.543
What I was turning you into.


01:13:33.343 --> 01:13:36.842
I'm... I'm sorry.


01:13:45.539 --> 01:13:50.038
I don't want your apology.
I want my Scroll.


01:13:51.739 --> 01:13:53.438
What?


01:13:53.738 --> 01:13:55.737
Where is it?


01:13:56.337 --> 01:14:00.936
Dragon Warrior has taken Scroll
half way across China by now.


01:14:01.936 --> 01:14:05.336
You will never see
that Scroll, Tai Lung!


01:14:05.535 --> 01:14:07.434
Never!


01:14:09.534 --> 01:14:11.434
Hey!


01:14:15.933 --> 01:14:17.133
Stairs.


01:14:19.832 --> 01:14:21.931
Who are you?


01:14:22.231 --> 01:14:26.231
Buddy, I am the Dragon Warrior.


01:14:29.730 --> 01:14:31.830
You?


01:14:31.930 --> 01:14:34.728
Him? He's a Panda.
You're a Panda.


01:14:34.928 --> 01:14:37.528
What are you going to do, big guy?
Sit on me.


01:14:38.128 --> 01:14:39.728
Don't tempt me.


01:14:40.227 --> 01:14:43.826
Now, I'm going to use this.


01:14:44.326 --> 01:14:46.726
You want it. Come get it.


01:14:48.126 --> 01:14:49.525
Finally.


01:15:16.319 --> 01:15:18.618
That Scroll is mine!


01:16:49.098 --> 01:16:51.198
The Scroll has given him power.


01:16:51.598 --> 01:16:53.997
No!


01:17:26.190 --> 01:17:29.389
Finally.
Oh, yes.


01:17:30.389 --> 01:17:35.687
The power of the Dragon Scroll
is mine!


01:17:40.087 --> 01:17:41.986
It's nothing!


01:17:44.085 --> 01:17:46.785
It's okay. I didn't get
it the first time either.


01:17:47.285 --> 01:17:52.584
- What?
- There is no secret ingredient.


01:17:54.783 --> 01:17:56.983
It's just you.


01:18:05.980 --> 01:18:08.880
Stop it! Ho, ho, ho.
I'm going to pee.


01:18:10.780 --> 01:18:13.679
Don't! No, don't.


01:19:20.964 --> 01:19:25.063
You can't defeat me.


01:19:29.562 --> 01:19:30.662
You...


01:19:32.061 --> 01:19:36.360
You're just a big
fat Panda!


01:19:37.860 --> 01:19:39.959
I'm not a big fat Panda.


01:19:40.959 --> 01:19:43.558
I'm the Big Fat Panda!


01:19:45.458 --> 01:19:48.457
The Wuxi finger hold?
Oh, you know this hold.


01:19:48.558 --> 01:19:52.157
You're bluffing. You're bluffing!
Shifu didn't teach you that!


01:19:52.656 --> 01:19:55.756
Nope. I figured it out.


01:19:55.856 --> 01:19:57.555
Skadoosh!


01:20:17.051 --> 01:20:18.951
Look!


01:20:19.450 --> 01:20:22.150
The Dragon Warrior.


01:20:48.044 --> 01:20:53.243
That's my boy! The big lovely
Kung Fu warrior is my son!


01:20:55.342 --> 01:20:57.242
Yes.


01:20:58.242 --> 01:21:00.641
Thanks Dad.


01:21:09.139 --> 01:21:11.338
Hey guys.


01:21:15.038 --> 01:21:18.537
- Master.
- Master.


01:21:19.937 --> 01:21:23.736
Master?
Master Shifu?


01:21:37.033 --> 01:21:41.032
Master!
Shifu! Shifu! Are you okay?


01:21:42.331 --> 01:21:45.531
Po.
You are alive.


01:21:45.731 --> 01:21:47.431
Or we are both dead.


01:21:47.431 --> 01:21:49.330
No Master, I didn't die.


01:21:49.430 --> 01:21:52.629
- I defeated Tai Lung.
- You did?


01:21:56.729 --> 01:22:01.927
Wow!
It is as Oogway foretold.


01:22:02.627 --> 01:22:06.326
You are the Dragon Warrior.


01:22:06.826 --> 01:22:11.325
You have brought peace
to this valley.


01:22:14.524 --> 01:22:17.724
And to me.
Thank you.


